#: ../../src/guide/about.rst:2
msgid "About"
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/guide/about.rst:4
msgid ""
"`Nikhil Marathe <https://nikhilism.com>`_ started writing this book one "
"afternoon (June 16, 2012) when he didn't feel like programming. He had "
"recently been stung by the lack of good documentation on libuv while "
"working on `node-taglib <https://github.com/nikhilm/node-taglib>`_. "
"Although reference documentation was present, there were no comprehensive"
" tutorials. This book is the output of that need and tries to be "
"accurate. That said, the book may have mistakes. Pull requests are "
"encouraged."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/guide/about.rst:12
msgid ""
"Nikhil is indebted to Marc Lehmann's comprehensive `man page "
"<http://pod.tst.eu/http://cvs.schmorp.de/libev/ev.pod>`_ about libev "
"which describes much of the semantics of the two libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/guide/about.rst:16
msgid ""
"This book was made using `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org>`_ and `vim "
"<https://www.vim.org>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/guide/about.rst:20
msgid ""
"In 2017 the libuv project incorporated the Nikhil's work into the "
"official documentation and it's maintained there henceforth."
msgstr ""

